          <p>
            Those figures are typical ranges gathered from common contractor pricing, not quotes, and your region, perimeter length, basement depth and access will move them by a lot. Our full breakdown of <a href="/basement-waterproofing-cost/">basement waterproofing cost</a> shows how to sanity-check a bid, and our <a href="/wet-basement-solutions/">wet basement solutions</a> guide covers the cheaper fixes to try before any of this.
          </p>

          <p>
            Two smaller jobs often get lost in the conversation about systems. A single leaking crack in a poured wall may need nothing more than a proper crack sealant, and our guide to <a href="/caulk-for-basement-wall-cracks/">caulk for basement wall cracks</a> covers what holds. And when you do buy a full system, compare the contractors and products on what they include rather than on brand promises. Our roundup of the <a href="/best-basement-waterproofing-systems/">best basement waterproofing systems</a> is the place to do that comparison.
          </p>
